@startuml
title Activity Diagram: Passenger Booking a Ride

|Passenger|
start
:Searches for Ride;

|#AntiqueWhite|CarConnect System|
:Displays Available Rides;

|Passenger|
:Selects a Ride;
:Sends Booking Request;

|CarConnect System|
:Notifies Driver of New Request;

|Driver|
:Reviews Request;
if (Accept Ride?) then (No)
  :Reject Request;
  |CarConnect System|
  :Notifies Passenger of Rejection;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Accept Request;
endif

|CarConnect System|
:Notifies Passenger of Acceptance;

|Passenger|
:Makes Payment;

|CarConnect System|
:Confirms Booking and Updates Database;

stop
@enduml
